      <guid>https://curriculum.codeyourfuture.io/guides/employability/learning/exercism/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;If your development plan involves learning a new language, you can join an &lt;a&#xA;  href=&#34;https://exercism.org/&#34;&gt;Exercism&lt;/a&gt; track. Some common languages grads choose to learn next are:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a&#xA;  href=&#34;https://exercism.org/tracks/php&#34;&gt;PHP track&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a&#xA;  href=&#34;https://exercism.org/tracks/csharp&#34;&gt;C# track&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a&#xA;  href=&#34;https://exercism.org/tracks/ruby&#34;&gt;Ruby track&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a&#xA;  href=&#34;https://exercism.org/tracks/typescript&#34;&gt;Typescript track&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a&#xA;  href=&#34;https://exercism.io/tracks/python&#34;&gt;Python track&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
